    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "CONTROLS:\n\u2022 WASD / Arrows \u2014 Move Chef\n\u2022 E \u2014 Context Interact (Grab from Fridge, Place on Table/Stove, Deliver to Window, Trash)\n\u2022 Q \u2014 Quick Collect from Table or Stove\n\u2022 1 / 2 / 3 \u2014 Select Fridge Ingredient (Vegetable / Cheese / Meat)\n\u2022 P / Esc \u2014 Pause Game\n\nRULES & STATIONS:\n\u2022 Vegetable: Chop 2s on Table (20 pts)\n\u2022 Cheese: Instant (10 pts)\n\u2022 Meat: Cook 6s on Stove (30 pts)\n\u2022 Score = Sum of Ingredients \u2212 Seconds Open (Floored). Max 4 active orders."
